    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6125" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφιφᾰνής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαίνομαι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>visible all round, seen by all, known to all,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Andr.</u>
				834
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				3.1324
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Orac.Chald.</u>
				300
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of stars,
				<i>seen twice in a night,</i> when they set after and rise
			before the sun, <i><span class="en">
				Gem.
				14.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				1.28.2
			</span></i>.</div>
